<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8" />
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
  <title>Security — securelayer.co</title>
  <style>
    *, *::before, *::after { box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0; padding: 0; }

    body {
      background: #0a0f0f;
      color: #e0e0e0;
      font-family: 'Helvetica Neue', Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;
      font-size: 14px;
      line-height: 1.6;
      min-height: 100vh;
    }

    .page { max-width: 860px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 40px 24px 80px; }

    a { color: inherit; text-decoration: none; }
    a:hover { text-decoration: underline; }

    .header-row {
      display: flex;
      justify-content: space-between;
      align-items: center;
      margin-bottom: 24px;
    }

    .site-title {
      font-size: 22px;
      font-weight: 700;
      letter-spacing: -0.3px;
      color: #fff;
    }

    .back-link {
      font-size: 12px;
      color: #555;
      text-decoration: none;
      letter-spacing: 0.3px;
    }
    .back-link:hover { color: #888; }

    .page-title { font-size: 20px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 4px; }
    .subtitle { font-size: 13px; color: #666; margin-bottom: 40px; }

    .scores-grid {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(240px, 1fr));
      gap: 16px;
      margin-bottom: 48px;
    }

    .score-card {
      background: #0d1a1a;
      border: 1px solid #1a3030;
      border-radius: 8px;
      padding: 24px;
      color: inherit;
      display: flex;
      flex-direction: column;
      gap: 16px;
    }

    .card-header {
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: space-between;
      gap: 12px;
    }

    .service-name {
      font-size: 13px;
      font-weight: 700;
      color: #aaa;
      letter-spacing: 0.3px;
    }

    .grade-badge {
      font-size: 22px;
      font-weight: 800;
      padding: 4px 12px;
      border-radius: 6px;
      line-height: 1.4;
      flex-shrink: 0;
    }
    .grade-Aplus  { color: #4ade80; background: #0d2a0d; border: 1px solid #166534; }
    .grade-A      { color: #a3e635; background: #1a2a08; border: 1px solid #365314; }
    .grade-safe   { color: #5eead4; background: #0d2a2a; border: 1px solid #0d9488; font-size: 13px; }
    .grade-pending { color: #a78bfa; background: #1a0d2a; border: 1px solid #6d28d9; font-size: 12px; }
    .grade-silver { color: #cbd5e1; background: #1a1e26; border: 1px solid #64748b; font-size: 13px; }

    .card-desc {
      font-size: 12px;
      color: #555;
      line-height: 1.5;
    }

    .card-link {
      font-size: 11px;
      color: #0d9488;
      letter-spacing: 0.3px;
    }

    .section-title {
      font-size: 13px;
      font-weight: 700;
      color: #888;
      letter-spacing: 0.8px;
      text-transform: uppercase;
      margin-bottom: 16px;
    }

    .contact-box {
      background: #0d1a1a;
      border: 1px solid #1a3030;
      border-radius: 8px;
      padding: 20px 24px;
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: space-between;
      gap: 24px;
      flex-wrap: wrap;
      margin-bottom: 48px;
    }
    .contact-box p { font-size: 13px; color: #aaa; }
    .contact-btn {
      display: inline-block;
      background: #0d2a2a;
      border: 1px solid #0d9488;
      border-radius: 5px;
      color: #5eead4;
      font-size: 13px;
      font-weight: 600;
      padding: 8px 20px;
      text-decoration: none;
      white-space: nowrap;
      transition: background 0.15s;
      flex-shrink: 0;
    }
    .contact-btn:hover { background: #0d3535; }

    .pipeline-card {
      background: #0d1a1a;
      border: 1px solid #1a3030;
      border-radius: 8px;
      padding: 24px;
      margin-bottom: 48px;
    }

    .pipeline-checks {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(200px, 1fr));
      gap: 16px;
    }

    .check-item {
      display: flex;
      align-items: flex-start;
      gap: 10px;
    }

    .check-icon {
      color: #4ade80;
      font-size: 14px;
      font-weight: 800;
      flex-shrink: 0;
      margin-top: 2px;
    }
    .check-icon.pending { color: #a78bfa; }

    .check-label strong {
      color: #e0e0e0;
      font-size: 12px;
      font-weight: 700;
      display: block;
      margin-bottom: 3px;
    }

    .check-label .check-desc {
      font-size: 11px;
      color: #555;
      line-height: 1.5;
    }

    .policy-section { margin-bottom: 40px; }
    .policy-section h2 {
      font-size: 13px;
      font-weight: 700;
      color: #888;
      letter-spacing: 0.8px;
      text-transform: uppercase;
      margin-bottom: 16px;
    }
    .policy-section p { color: #999; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 12px; }

    .timeline-grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; gap: 16px; }
    .timeline-card { background: #0d1a1a; border: 1px solid #1a3030; border-radius: 8px; padding: 20px; }
    .tl-days { font-size: 1.75rem; font-weight: 800; color: #5eead4; line-height: 1; margin-bottom: 4px; }
    .tl-label { font-size: .75rem; font-weight: 700; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: .06em; color: #e0e0e0; margin-bottom: 8px; }
    .tl-desc { font-size: .8rem; color: #666; line-height: 1.5; }

    .sec-list { list-style: none; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 6px; }
    .sec-list li { font-size: 13px; color: #999; padding-left: 18px; position: relative; }
    .sec-list li::before { content: '—'; position: absolute; left: 0; color: #0d9488; }
    .sec-list.muted li::before { color: #333; }

    @media (max-width: 480px) {
      .timeline-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
    }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
<div class="page">

  <div class="header-row">
    <h1 class="site-title"><a href="/">SecureLayer</a></h1>
    <a class="back-link" href="/">← Back</a>
  </div>

  <p class="page-title">🔒 Security</p>
  <p class="subtitle">Third-party security assessments for securelayer.co</p>

  <div class="scores-grid">

    <div class="score-card">
      <div class="card-header">
        <span class="service-name">HTTP Headers<br>Security Grade</span>
        <span class="grade-badge grade-pending">Pending</span>
      </div>
      <p class="card-desc">Tests HTTP headers, CSP, cookies, and HTTPS configuration against Mozilla's security guidelines. Not yet run against this domain.</p>
      <a class="card-link" href="https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/observatory/analyze?host=securelayer.co" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Run scan ↗</a>
    </div>

    <div class="score-card">
      <div class="card-header">
        <span class="service-name">SSL/TLS Server<br>Security Grade</span>
        <span class="grade-badge grade-pending">Scanning…</span>
      </div>
      <p class="card-desc">Qualys SSL Labs deep analysis of TLS configuration, certificate chain, and cipher suites. First scan for this domain is in progress.</p>
      <a class="card-link" href="https://www.ssllabs.com/ssltest/analyze.html?d=securelayer.co" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">View live report ↗</a>
    </div>

    <div class="score-card">
      <div class="card-header">
        <span class="service-name">Security Headers<br>Grade</span>
        <span class="grade-badge grade-pending">Pending</span>
      </div>
      <p class="card-desc">Scans and grades HTTP response headers for completeness and security best practices. CSP, HSTS, X-Frame-Options, X-Content-Type-Options, and Referrer-Policy are already present — grade not yet confirmed.</p>
      <a class="card-link" href="https://securityheaders.com/?q=https%3A%2F%2Fsecurelayer.co" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Run scan ↗</a>
    </div>

    <div class="score-card">
      <div class="card-header">
        <span class="service-name">Blacklight<br>Privacy Checker</span>
        <span class="grade-badge grade-pending">Pending</span>
      </div>
      <p class="card-desc">Checks for ad trackers, third-party cookies, fingerprinting, session recording, keylogging, and social pixels. Not yet run against this domain.</p>
      <a class="card-link" href="https://themarkup.org/blacklight?url=securelayer.co" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Run scan ↗</a>
    </div>

    <div class="score-card">
      <div class="card-header">
        <span class="service-name">Google<br>Safe Browsing</span>
        <span class="grade-badge grade-pending">Pending</span>
      </div>
      <p class="card-desc">Checks for malware, phishing, or unwanted software flagged on this site.</p>
      <a class="card-link" href="https://transparencyreport.google.com/safe-browsing/search?url=securelayer.co" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Check report ↗</a>
    </div>

    <div class="score-card">
      <div class="card-header">
        <span class="service-name">GDPR<br>Compliance Checker</span>
        <span class="grade-badge grade-pending">Pending</span>
      </div>
      <p class="card-desc">Scans for consent violations, cookie issues, and data protection concerns.</p>
      <a class="card-link" href="https://2gdpr.com/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Run scan ↗</a>
    </div>

    <div class="score-card">
      <div class="card-header">
        <span class="service-name">OpenSSF Scorecard</span>
        <span class="grade-badge grade-pending">Not yet scanned</span>
      </div>
      <p class="card-desc">Automated supply-chain security analysis of github.com/SecureLayer/tmp — checks branch protection, token permissions, and CI hygiene. Workflow just added; first score pending.</p>
      <a class="card-link" href="https://scorecard.dev/viewer/?uri=github.com/SecureLayer/tmp" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">View scorecard ↗</a>
    </div>

    <div class="score-card">
      <div class="card-header">
        <span class="service-name">OpenSSF<br>Best Practices</span>
        <span class="grade-badge grade-pending">13% — in progress</span>
      </div>
      <p class="card-desc">CII Best Practices badge — certifies the project follows open-source security and quality standards. Registered, questionnaire in progress.</p>
      <a class="card-link" href="https://www.bestpractices.dev/en/projects/11681" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">View progress ↗</a>
    </div>

    <div class="score-card">
      <div class="card-header">
        <span class="service-name">Snyk</span>
        <span class="grade-badge grade-pending">Not connected</span>
      </div>
      <p class="card-desc">Dependency vulnerability scanning for github.com/SecureLayer/tmp. Not yet connected to Snyk.</p>
      <a class="card-link" href="https://snyk.io/test/github/SecureLayer/tmp" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Run scan ↗</a>
    </div>

  </div>

  <p class="section-title">Platform Integrity</p>
  <div class="pipeline-card">
    <div class="pipeline-checks">

      <div class="check-item">
        <span class="check-icon">✓</span>
        <span class="check-label">
          <strong>Cloudflare edge security</strong>
          <span class="check-desc">Bot Fight Mode and WAF custom rules active in front of the origin.</span>
        </span>
      </div>

      <div class="check-item">
        <span class="check-icon">✓</span>
        <span class="check-label">
          <strong>Dependabot</strong>
          <span class="check-desc">Automated dependency PRs, verified active — npm packages kept current on a weekly schedule.</span>
        </span>
      </div>

      <div class="check-item">
        <span class="check-icon">✓</span>
        <span class="check-label">
          <strong>Security response headers</strong>
          <span class="check-desc">CSP, HSTS (1yr + subdomains), X-Frame-Options: DENY, X-Content-Type-Options: nosniff, Referrer-Policy: no-referrer.</span>
        </span>
      </div>

      <div class="check-item">
        <span class="check-icon pending">◐</span>
        <span class="check-label">
          <strong>OpenSSF Scorecard CI</strong>
          <span class="check-desc">Scorecard workflow added — publishes automatically to the code-scanning dashboard on next push to main.</span>
        </span>
      </div>

    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="policy-section">
    <h2>Reporting a vulnerability</h2>
    <p>Do not open a public GitHub issue for security vulnerabilities.</p>
  </div>

  <div class="contact-box">
    <p>Email <strong style="color:#5eead4">contact@securelayer.co</strong> with subject <code style="color:#5eead4">[SECURITY] &lt;short description&gt;</code> — include steps to reproduce, affected component, and potential impact.</p>
    <a class="contact-btn" href="mailto:contact@securelayer.co?subject=%5BSECURITY%5D%20">Report by email ↗</a>
  </div>

  <div class="policy-section">
    <h2>Response timeline</h2>
    <div class="timeline-grid">
      <div class="timeline-card">
        <div class="tl-days">14 days</div>
        <div class="tl-label">Acknowledgement</div>
        <div class="tl-desc">We confirm receipt of your report and begin investigation.</div>
      </div>
      <div class="timeline-card">
        <div class="tl-days">60 days</div>
        <div class="tl-label">Resolution</div>
        <div class="tl-desc">Target for resolving confirmed vulnerabilities from date of confirmation.</div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="policy-section">
    <h2>Scope</h2>
    <p>SecureLayer is a static site serving cybersecurity prompt content. The primary security concerns are:</p>
    <ul class="sec-list">
      <li>Prompt content containing secrets or misleading security advice</li>
      <li>Supply chain issues in build dependencies</li>
      <li>Deployment pipeline integrity</li>
    </ul>
  </div>

  <div class="policy-section">
    <h2>Out of scope</h2>
    <ul class="sec-list muted">
      <li>Social engineering</li>
      <li>Issues in third-party infrastructure (GitHub, Cloudflare)</li>
    </ul>
  </div>

</div>
</body>
</html>
